{"name": "Light of Atlantis", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Switch</strong> between robots and water levels to <strong>solve </strong>long forgotten puzzles and\u00a0<strong>explore </strong>the wondrous depths of Atlantis.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/171a386353c9ff0045bed382aa6238d0.poster.avif?t=1795543398\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/171a386353c9ff0045bed382aa6238d0.webm?t=1795543398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/171a386353c9ff0045bed382aa6238d0.mp4?t=1795543398\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WATER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Atlantians adapted to the sinking of their island by using their powerful technology to control the water levels. Water as a central element not only changes what abilities are available but also influences the objects around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"194\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/65eda6347b9b034cba4f7e11701cb190.poster.avif?t=1795543398\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/65eda6347b9b034cba4f7e11701cb190.webm?t=1795543398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/65eda6347b9b034cba4f7e11701cb190.mp4?t=1795543398\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROBOTS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various worker robots inhabit the remnants of Atlantis, each with their own abilities. Switch between them and use their powers wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/c67b02b3644b7007a752207c92c29c89.poster.avif?t=1795543398\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/c67b02b3644b7007a752207c92c29c89.webm?t=1795543398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/c67b02b3644b7007a752207c92c29c89.mp4?t=1795543398\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PUZZLES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atlantis is a place full of weird mysteries and puzzles. Use the water and the robot's unique abilities to solve the puzzles. Gain new knowledge about the world's mechanics to overcome unforeseen obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"310\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/3064ef85d1cf190a09cb03770de7773a.poster.avif?t=1795543398\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/3064ef85d1cf190a09cb03770de7773a.webm?t=1795543398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/3064ef85d1cf190a09cb03770de7773a.mp4?t=1795543398\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets await and tell of a story long lost in the sunken city of Atlantis. Surprisingly sympathetic robots cross your way, doomed to work for eternity unless someone could help them for a change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/e7da903d3a481e596a73c856ef954ec7.poster.avif?t=1795543398\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/e7da903d3a481e596a73c856ef954ec7.webm?t=1795543398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/extras/e7da903d3a481e596a73c856ef954ec7.mp4?t=1795543398\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NO AI WAS USED IN THE PRODUCTION OF THIS GAME <br/>EVERYTHING YOU EXPERIENCE HERE IS HANDCRAFTED BY HUMANS</h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Explore the depths of the ocean in this 2D-Puzzle-Metroidvania! Control the water levels and switch between various robots to solve the ancient puzzles of Atlantis.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387740/c1fc03a62487c0ab14fbb6b2fca5189c4a004790/header.jpg?t=1795543398", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Metroidvania", "Puzzle Platformer", "Exploration", "Mystery Dungeon", "Underwater", "Puzzle"], "developers": "Duck 'n' Run Games", "publishers": "Duck 'n' Run Games", "release_date": "Nov 24, 2026", "price": "$15.99", "appid": "2387740", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "24 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/IBYTuTgLg2k", "first_seen": 1795474800.0, "review_rank": 1}